# Copy to /etc/kajianq/api.env on the VPS: `install -o root -g root -m 0600`.
# Read by systemd as `EnvironmentFile` for kajianq-api.service AND
# kajianq-cron.service — this one file is the serving process's whole
# configuration (plus the cron entry's, which reads the same DATABASE_URL).
# Never commit the filled-in file. Every value below is a placeholder; the real
# ones live in the owner's password manager.
#
# The keys mirror apps/api/src/lib/server.ts's PASSTHROUGH_KEYS exactly
# (tests/scripts/vps-hardening.test.mjs pins the two in sync) — read once at
# the composition root; business logic never touches env.* directly.
#
# DATABASE_URL         the self-hosted Postgres (loopback; ADR-0044 decision 5).
#                      Password required: over TCP, md5/scram auth applies.
# APP_ENV              "production" (or "staging"); drives log posture.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS      the strict CORS allowlist — the public origin.
# SENTRY_DSN           optional; omit to disable error reporting.
#
# Provider keys. An absent key means that role's keyed candidates are
# filtered out at wiring — for the REVIEWER and EMBEDDER chain heads this
# takes the whole chat path down with a typed error, so these two are
# owner-provisioned preconditions of the cutover (the enforcement test
# apps/api/src/lib/personal-data-serving.test.ts pins the config side):
#   GEMINI_PAID_API_KEY  the embedder head (gemini-paid:gemini-embedding-001)
#   GEMINI_API_KEY       the cheap-role free-tier candidate (filtered for
#                        personal-data calls; kept for parity with the config)
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY     the generator/router AND reviewer paid head
#                        (same-vendor review accepted by owner amendment, 2026-09-21)
#   DASHSCOPE_API_KEY    catalogued generator challenger (optional)
#   JEV_API_KEY          the decision vendor's serving key: binds the reviewer
#                        pre-gate (#168, ADR-0042). Optional and fail-open — an
#                        absent key means the reviewer runs on every answer
#                        exactly as before adoption, so it is never a boot
#                        precondition. Bound = the pre-gate is active (no
#                        enable flag exists; owner decision 2026-09-19).
#
# SCOPE_EXPANSION_CAP  ADR-0045's surah-reference scope-expansion budget: the
#                      most children of a named surah added to the fused hits
#                      (non-negative integer; `0` disables the expansion;
#                      absent = the domain default of 12; a malformed value is
#                      a typed config failure, not a silent default).
#
# NEIGHBOUR_EXPANSION_RADIUS  ADR-0049's retrieved-verse neighbourhood window:
#                      how many ordinals on each side of a verse already in
#                      context join the context (non-negative integer; `<= 0`
#                      disables the expansion; absent = the domain default of
#                      1; malformed = typed config failure).
#
# NEIGHBOUR_EXPANSION_CAP  How many chunks that neighbourhood expansion may add
#                      to one query (non-negative integer; `<= 0` disables it;
#                      absent = the domain default of 12; malformed = typed
#                      config failure). Both knobs are what keep the widening
#                      bounded — uncapped, a radius of one adds a measured p50
#                      of 46 chunks to a Quran-bearing query.
#
# KAJIANQ_WEB_ROOT     where the disk ASSETS handle finds the shipped web
#                      build. The unit's WorkingDirectory is /srv/kajianq/api,
#                      so the default ("./apps/web/dist") would resolve to a
#                      path that does not exist on the deployed tree and every
#                      SPA route would 503 while /v1/health stays green — this
#                      line is load-bearing, not cosmetic (deploy.sh ships
#                      web to ${KAJIANQ_DEPLOY_ROOT}/web, default /srv/kajianq/web).

DATABASE_URL=postgres://kajianq:CHANGE_ME@127.0.0.1:5432/kajianq
APP_ENV=production
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://chat.example.org
SENTRY_DSN=
GEMINI_PAID_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME
GEMINI_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME
JEV_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME
SCOPE_EXPANSION_CAP=12
NEIGHBOUR_EXPANSION_RADIUS=1
NEIGHBOUR_EXPANSION_CAP=12
KAJIANQ_WEB_ROOT=/srv/kajianq/web